    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/889e0923d0718bef79264ec36cb85b9b.poster.avif?t=1676940108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/889e0923d0718bef79264ec36cb85b9b.webm?t=1676940108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/889e0923d0718bef79264ec36cb85b9b.mp4?t=1676940108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>The Busker is a <strong>Metroidvania</strong> 2D platformer where you explore a dystopian urban landscape. Fight bosses to unlock new abilities like double jump, triple jump, dash and rocket dash. Discover hidden areas and faster routes through the game. Smash your enemies with your trusty guitar and acquire new instruments to unleash more damage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/ab27008656680889d1e41e78896c5ad0.poster.avif?t=1676940108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/ab27008656680889d1e41e78896c5ad0.webm?t=1676940108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1943840/extras/ab27008656680889d1e41e78896c5ad0.mp4?t=1676940108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer</h2>This is a solo game development project. <br>My name is Kevin Sullivan and I'm a UX / Graphic Designer by trade.",
